sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant Web as Next.js
  participant API as Agent Module
  participant LLM as LLM Provider
  participant Tools as Domain Tools
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  U->>Web: Natural language request
  Web->>API: POST /agent/threads/:id/messages
  API->>DB: store user message
  API->>LLM: messages + tool schemas
  LLM-->>API: tool_call
  API->>Tools: execute tenant-scoped
  Tools->>DB: query or write
  Tools-->>API: result
  API->>LLM: tool result
  LLM-->>API: final message
  API->>DB: persist audit
  API-->>Web: SSE answer
